:HELP   NAME='AARFLR'.Auto Archive Folder
:XH3.Auto Archive Folder
:p.This is the path where reports are automatically archived to.
:p.This is used by the output options system to archive requested reports. The
system allows users to automatically archive all reports to a specific
folder. The reports are archived as PDF files. The path needs to be
a path in the IFS. The user running the report must have permission to access
the folder.
:p.The QNTC system can be used to archive reports on local network shared
drives. If using the QNTC file system the user signed on to the IBM i server
must have access to the NFS share.
:P.Screen: USRMSTF7 Field: AARFLR
Type: CHAR(128)
Location: (19,21)
:EHELP.
